B.bk6=new A.bp(B.du,["1. Platform Overview & Dynamic QR Services","Mport, operated under Maple Pro, provides merchant software for dynamic QR code generation, multi-link mobile profiles, cloud hosting for restaurant PDF menus and catalogs, and custom tabletop acrylic standees. By signing up or subscribing, you agree to these Terms of Service."],t.l)
B.bk7=new A.bp(B.du,["2. Dynamic Standee Continuity & Uptime SLA","Our dynamic QR routing ensures that once your physical standee is manufactured and printed, you may alter your underlying links, menus, or contact details at any time without rendering the physical QR code obsolete. We target a 99.9% cloud availability rate supported by global CDN infrastructure."],t.l)
B.bk8=new A.bp(B.du,["3. Subscription Tiers & Voluntary Renewal","All client subscriptions are billed on a non-automatic debit basis. We do NOT store card CVVs or initiate silent auto-debits without explicit consent. When a plan period ends, you are prompted with an in-app renewal notice. You may upgrade, downgrade, or pause service at any time."],t.l)
B.bk3=new A.bp(B.du,["4. Safe Profile Guarantee","In the event of a subscription expiration, your business profile, menu links, and custom QR configuration are preserved safely on our cloud database. Your profile is never permanently purged, allowing instant restoration whenever you choose to resume service."],t.l)
B.b40=A.a(s([B.bk6,B.bk7,B.bk8,B.bk3]),t.SN)
B.bN3=new A.yb(B.b40,null)
B.bk_=new A.bp(B.du,["1. Merchant Information We Collect","We collect essential merchant credentials required to maintain your account: business name, contact phone number, email address, and optional brand logos or menu PDFs. Financial payment information is handled directly by PCI-DSS compliant Indian payment gateways (Razorpay) and is never stored on our application servers."],t.l)
B.bjX=new A.bp(B.du,["2. Zero Tracking of End Consumers (Scanners)",'We respect consumer privacy. When patrons or diners scan your table standee, we do NOT collect their personal identity, names, phone numbers, or device tracking IDs. We record purely aggregated, anonymous scan counters (e.g. "Table 4 received 18 scans today") to help you measure footfall.'],t.l)
B.bk1=new A.bp(B.du,["3. Strict Multi-Tenant Data Isolation","Every business account is segregated using encrypted tenant isolation keys. A merchant has access exclusively to their own profiles, menus, and billing history. No competitor or third party can view your analytics or private merchant settings."],t.l)
B.bjY=new A.bp(B.du,["4. Data Retention & Deletion Rights","You retain 100% ownership of your media assets and business data. You may request complete account deletion or media purge at any time by contacting our Merchant Concierge desk."],t.l)
B.aZH=A.a(s([B.bk_,B.bjX,B.bk1,B.bjY]),t.SN)
